{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20836","headline":"苏小小墓 · 李贺","name":"苏小小墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽兰露，如啼眼。\n无物结同心，烟花不堪剪。\n草如茵，松如盖。\n风爲裳，水爲佩。\n油壁车，夕相待。\n冷翠烛，劳光彩。\n西陵下，风吹雨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》卷三九一、《唐诗鉴赏辞典》李贺条（上海辞书出版社，1983）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）"}